schemaVersion: 1
id: slack-triage-root
name: Slack Support Desk
kind: root
version: 0.2.0
description: A request queue for your team's Slack channel. Every request with its owner, its state and its age, and a nudge when one sits too long.
entry: index.md
domain: Operations
app: triage-board
connectors:
  - id: slack
    need: needs
    access:
      - read
      - post
    why: Reads your support channel. Posts one nudge a day only where you set Write.
    usedBy:
      - jobs/support-triage
      - jobs/desk-nudge
      - jobs/weekly-patterns
prompts:
  - text: What in the support channel has no owner yet?
    connector: slack
  - text: Which requests have had no owner for over 4 hours?
    connector: slack
  - text: What is the oldest open request, and who has it?
    connector: slack
  - text: What is waiting on a customer right now?
    connector: slack
  - text: What did support finish today?
    connector: slack
  - text: Which kind of request came in most this week?
    connector: slack
  - text: Which request will hurt most if it sits until tomorrow?
    connector: slack
  - text: Did the desk post a nudge today, and what did it say?
    connector: slack
